[{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-1011","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-1011.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0911","title":"Horde IMP 任意文件读取和删除漏洞","description":"IMP（互联网邮件协议）Web 邮件系统 2.2 及更早版本存在任意文件读取与删除漏洞。攻击者可通过修改表单中的 attachment_name 隐藏字段值，诱使服务器将目标文件作为邮件附件发送给攻击者，从而实现任意文件读取。该漏洞源于对用户输入验证不充分，攻击者无需身份认证即可远程利用，导致敏感信息泄露。CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0911"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-12-19T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:44Z","remediation":"升级 IMP 至 2.3 或更高版本，该版本已修复 attachment_name 隐藏表单变量未校验的问题。如无法升级，修改源代码中 attachment_name 处理逻辑，对用户提交的 attachment_name 值进行路径白名单校验，禁止包含 ../ 等目录遍历字符，并限制只能操作临时附件目录内的文件。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/82088","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1679","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5227","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/8491df4167cab37455be87043bbd4187ade74c40/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0911.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/3eab0e512529a79daadefaadf0f05372813e7876/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0911.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0911","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0911.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0911.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/20ec019115a0b1de7bc97fc35bb5f73fa34a0aae/2000/CVE-2000-0911.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/e9b51a58e4ac0e6b00dc38147f459707e98ae056/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-09xx/CVE-2000-0911.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/a939a0e06ea28df0537defbf2bf781fcb02ed201/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0911.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0911.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0911.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-1011.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-1011.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-1011.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-1010","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-1010.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0910","title":"Horde Horde library 远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Horde 库 1.02 版本中存在命令注入漏洞，攻击者可通过在邮件\"发件人\"（from）地址字段中插入 shell 元字符（如分号、管道符等）来执行任意系统命令。该漏洞利用条件为攻击者能够控制发送给 Horde 应用的邮件地址输入，无需身份认证即可触发。成功利用后攻击者可获取服务器权限，执行任意命令，对系统机密性、完整性和可用性造成中等程度危害。建议升级至修复版本或对用户输入进行严格过滤。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0910"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-12-19T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:44Z","remediation":"立即应用 Horde 官方补丁 hordelib-1.2.0.frombug.patch（下载地址：http://ssl.coc-ag.de/sec/hordelib-1.2.0.frombug.patch），该补丁对 from 地址字段中的 shell 元字符进行转义处理。Debian 用户可参考安全公告 DSA-20000910 进行系统更新。如无法立即打补丁，建议在邮件传输代理（MTA）或应用层对邮件地址输入进行严格过滤，禁止分号、管道符、反引号等特殊字符。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-09/0051.html","http://ssl.coc-ag.de/sec/hordelib-1.2.0.frombug.patch","http://www.debian.org/security/2000/20000910","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1674","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5278","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/8491df4167cab37455be87043bbd4187ade74c40/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0910.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/3eab0e512529a79daadefaadf0f05372813e7876/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0910.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0910","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0910.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0910.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/80a58667e7dc9efd6d76b74cf4de29bd42310fd5/2000/CVE-2000-0910.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/e9b51a58e4ac0e6b00dc38147f459707e98ae056/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-09xx/CVE-2000-0910.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/a939a0e06ea28df0537defbf2bf781fcb02ed201/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0910.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0910.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/2ea9851780633b2caab16fe048a14b38ca9a0b56/content/CVE-2000-0910.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-1010.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-1010.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-1007","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-1007.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0907","title":"EServ SMTP 远程代码执行漏洞","description":"EServ 2.92 Build 2982 的 SMTP 服务在处理超长 HELO 和 MAIL FROM 命令时存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。远程攻击者无需身份认证即可向目标服务器的 25 端口发送特制的超长 SMTP 命令，触发缓冲区溢出，导致服务进程崩溃（拒绝服务），在特定条件下还可执行任意代码。该漏洞影响 EServ 2.92 及可能更早版本，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0907"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-12-19T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:44Z","remediation":"建议立即将 EServ 升级至 2.97 或更高版本（该版本修复了 SMTP 命令长度校验缺陷），或彻底替换为现代邮件服务器软件（如 hMailServer、MailEnable）。如无法立即升级，可在防火墙上限制外部 IP 对 TCP 端口 25 的访问，仅允许可信来源连接 SMTP 服务，以降低远程利用风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/win2ksecadvice/2000-q3/0131.html","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/8491df4167cab37455be87043bbd4187ade74c40/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0907.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/16f8cf2a3c129bb57f3727599f3730e6001c1186/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0907.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0907","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0907.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0907.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/7c13974e8672408967145db42c357210cb59d951/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-09xx/CVE-2000-0907.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/afea9e4d3a1176ab218afc5d6d560a6f135838c1/2000/CVE-2000-0907.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/a939a0e06ea28df0537defbf2bf781fcb02ed201/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0907.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0907.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0907.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-1007.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-1005","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-1005.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0905","title":"QNX Voyager Webserver 敏感信息泄露漏洞","description":"QNX Voyager Web Server 2.01B 版本（随 QNX 405 演示光盘发布）中的 Embedded Resource Manager 存在信息泄露漏洞。远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过访问 embedded.html 页面获取系统敏感统计信息，如 CPU 使用率、内存状态、进程列表等。该漏洞利用条件简单，攻击者只需能够网络访问目标服务器的 HTTP 服务即可实施，可能导致系统内部信息暴露，为进一步攻击提供情报支持。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0905"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-12-19T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:43Z","remediation":"QNX Voyager webserver 2.01B 已停止维护，建议升级到受支持的 QNX 版本或替换为其他 Web 服务器。如无法升级，可在 Web 服务器配置中限制对 embedded.html 页面的访问，或通过防火墙规则限制对 80 端口的非授权访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/79956","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1648"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-1005.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-1005.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-1005.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-1004","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-1004.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0902","title":"PhotoAlbum getalbum.php 任意文件读取漏洞","description":"PhotoAlbum 0.9.9 之前版本中的 getalbum.php 存在路径遍历漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向目标发送包含 `..` 的特殊构造请求，绕过目录限制读取服务器上的任意文件。该漏洞源于对用户输入的文件路径参数缺乏充分的过滤和校验，攻击者无需身份认证即可利用，可能导致敏感信息泄露（如配置文件、数据库凭证等）。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0902"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-12-19T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:43Z","remediation":"立即将 PhotoAlbum 升级至 0.9.9 或更高版本，该版本已修复 getalbum.php 中路径遍历漏洞。如无法升级，在 Web 服务器层（如 Apache mod_rewrite 或 Nginx）添加规则，拦截包含 `../` 或 `..\\\\` 的请求参数，并对 `file` 参数做白名单校验，仅允许读取指定目录下的文件。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/80858","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5209","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/1cc9b895b10fb3dcc8a308563cbbcfad083cd221/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0902.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/16f8cf2a3c129bb57f3727599f3730e6001c1186/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0902.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0902","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0902.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0902.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/7c13974e8672408967145db42c357210cb59d951/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-09xx/CVE-2000-0902.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/38684c3fd0857f0d63926dad0cf55972b80db69f/2000/CVE-2000-0902.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/a939a0e06ea28df0537defbf2bf781fcb02ed201/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0902.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0902.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0902.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-1004.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-1003","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-1003.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0900","title":"thttpd ssi CGI 目录遍历任意文件读取漏洞","description":"thttpd 2.19 及更早版本中的 ssi CGI 程序存在目录遍历漏洞。攻击者可通过向目标服务器发送包含 \"%2e%2e\"（即 URL 编码的 \"..\" 序列）的特殊构造 HTTP 请求，绕过路径限制，读取服务器上任意可读文件。该漏洞无需身份认证即可远程利用，可导致敏感信息泄露（如配置文件、密码文件等），CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高危。目前官方尚未发布针对此旧版本的安全更新，建议升级至不受影响的版本或禁用 ssi CGI 功能。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0900"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-12-19T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:43Z","remediation":"升级 thttpd 至 2.20 或更高版本，该版本已修复 ssi CGI 程序中对 \"%2e%2e\" 序列的路径过滤缺陷。如无法升级，可禁用 ssi CGI 功能或配置 Web 服务器在请求到达前拦截包含 \"%2e%2e\" 的 URL 路径。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-10/0025.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1737","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5313","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/1cc9b895b10fb3dcc8a308563cbbcfad083cd221/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0900.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/5828423617831cae14862aac31158752df709f44/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0900.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0900","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0900.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0900.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/38684c3fd0857f0d63926dad0cf55972b80db69f/2000/CVE-2000-0900.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/a939a0e06ea28df0537defbf2bf781fcb02ed201/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0900.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/7c13974e8672408967145db42c357210cb59d951/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-09xx/CVE-2000-0900.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0900.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0900.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-1003.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0959","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0959.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0811","title":"Auction Weaver 目录遍历任意文件读取漏洞","description":"Auction Weaver 1.0 至 1.04 版本存在路径遍历漏洞，远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过在 username 或 bidfile 表单字段中注入 ..（点点）序列实现目录跳转，从而读取服务器上的任意文件。该漏洞源于应用程序未对用户输入的文件路径进行充分过滤和校验，导致攻击者可越权访问系统敏感文件，造成信息泄露。CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0811"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-12-19T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:31Z","remediation":"该产品已停止维护，无官方补丁可用。建议立即停用 Auction Weaver 或将应用迁移至其他仍在维护的竞拍平台。如无法停用，应在 Web 服务器（如 Apache/Nginx）层面配置输入过滤规则，拦截包含 `..` 或 `%2e%2e` 的请求参数；同时限制 Web 进程对文件系统的读取权限，仅允许访问应用必需目录，防止读取 `/etc/passwd` 等敏感文件。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.osvdb.org/4053","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1783","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5372","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/b160e6f2915ac726b29ee0689fc920f5016abef5/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0811.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/84cdd54c70c68603acd478a90957e5c6d8e65c65/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0811.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0811"