urityfocus.com/bid/1782","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5371","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a4cc8a55779a13aab23d5f0d0cd6e52496b071eb/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0810.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/84cdd54c70c68603acd478a90957e5c6d8e65c65/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0810.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0810","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0810.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/9b1777f43cb72006ac01427b6823146d45a3862a/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0810.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/6c0593e61f0f414ea233c11da6523481203bd9cf/2000/CVE-2000-0810.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/aa26e43cea95c9f8fa4c03fce1cced7c702a4035/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0810.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/b9f52bb052695dac5cabbd58e049eaac73697161/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-08xx/CVE-2000-0810.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0810.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0810.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0958.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0958.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0958.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0918","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0918.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0974","title":"GNU Privacy Guard (GnuPG) 多文档签名验证绕过漏洞","description":"GnuPG (gpg) 1.0.3 在验证包含多个文档的签名文件时存在签名校验缺陷，仅对第一个文档进行完整性校验，而忽略了后续文档的签名验证。远程攻击者可在不破坏整体签名有效性的前提下，篡改多文档签名文件中除首个文档外的任意文档内容，导致受害者信任被篡改后的恶意数据。该漏洞攻击复杂度低，无需身份认证，可对机密性、完整性和可用性造成部分影响。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0974"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-12-19T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:53Z","remediation":"建议升级 GnuPG 至 1.0.4 或更高版本，该版本修复了多文档签名验证不完整的问题。如无法升级，应避免直接信任 gpg 对多文档文件的签名结果，对每个文档单独验证签名后再使用。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-10/0201.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-10/0361.html","http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000334","http://www.debian.org/security/2000/20001111","http://www.osvdb.org/1608","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2000-089.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1797","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5386","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/94290d9b87aa464f4465c4bb2b955170c77f08c2/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0974.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0974","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/5d8a0e95a20fbbbf3a45b439096d57770d841dec/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0974.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0974.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/e9abd745a1d6114f0fa7d3f67607c023bdf3fa37/2000/CVE-2000-0974.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0974.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/e2cba2a029d0a53c95f0000f5eb42e0eb69717b8/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0974.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-09xx/CVE-2000-0974.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0974.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0974.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0918.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0918.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0914","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0914.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0963","title":"GNU ncurses 库缓冲区溢出本地代码执行漏洞","description":"ncurses 库存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，本地攻击者可通过设置超长的环境变量（如 TERM 或 TERMINFO_DIRS）触发该漏洞，导致执行任意命令。该漏洞影响使用 ncurses 库的多个 Linux 发行版（包括 Immunix 等），CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高。攻击者需拥有本地系统访问权限，利用方式为向受影响程序传递特制的环境变量数据，溢出缓冲区后劫持控制流执行恶意代码。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0963"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-12-19T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-07-23T18:58:25Z","remediation":"将 ncurses 库升级至 5.6 或更高版本。对于使用 ncurses 的发行版（如 Caldera OpenLinux），安装厂商提供的安全补丁（参考 CSSA-2000-036）。如无法立即升级，可限制本地用户设置过长的 TERM/TERMINFO_DIRS 环境变量，或通过系统级环境变量长度检查脚本拦截超长输入作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.calderasystems.com/support/security/advisories/CSSA-2000-036.0.txt","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/138550","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1142","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/44487","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/160b2769d023cca3bba96db1842bf8222b2e286a/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0963.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0963","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2850e862cb7837f03ec4af0066c4f9f10414e805/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0963.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0963.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/551efeab39fccbe54b7908ab00ab9eb71b9e0872/2000/CVE-2000-0963.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/c45038e15e6e81771cce5512f28070ebf02ca969/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0963.md","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0963.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0963.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-09xx/CVE-2000-0963.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0963.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0914.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0912","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0912.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0956","title":"Red Hat Linux Cyrus SASL 本地授权验证绕过漏洞","description":"cyrus-sasl 1.5.24 之前版本在 Red Hat Linux 7.0 中存在授权验证缺陷，本地用户可通过绕过系统设定的访问限制，获取非授权的资源访问权限。该漏洞源于 SASL 库对本地用户授权检查不充分，攻击者利用本地账户即可触发，无需网络访问。成功利用后可导致机密性、完整性和可用性部分受损，CVSS 评分 4.6，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0956"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-12-19T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:51Z","remediation":"升级 cyrus-sasl 至 1.5.24 或更高版本。对于 Red Hat Linux 7.0 系统，通过 `up2date cyrus-sasl` 命令更新软件包，或从 Red Hat 官方仓库下载最新 RPM 包手动安装。如无法升级，可通过限制本地用户对 SASL 认证服务的访问权限作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2000-094.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1875","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5427","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a0edea60322bafbed67887cf7a4d97a55df8a9fa/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0956.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/e6d30197c1ae0e0b416414f6f0ed16544575a73f/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0956.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0956","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0956.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0956.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-09xx/CVE-2000-0956.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/08861b52e373e5d8411b1b6670fe650ef2757f4b/2000/CVE-2000-0956.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/c45038e15e6e81771cce5512f28070ebf02ca969/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0956.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0956.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0956.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0912.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0910","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0910.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0948","title":"GnoRPM 符号链接攻击任意文件修改漏洞","description":"GnoRPM 0.95 之前版本存在符号链接攻击漏洞。当本地用户运行 GnoRPM 处理 RPM 包时，程序未对临时文件路径进行充分校验，攻击者可通过在临时目录中预先创建恶意符号链接，诱使 GnoRPM 以 root 权限写入任意系统文件，从而实现本地权限提升。该漏洞影响 Linux 系统中使用 GnoRPM 管理 RPM 包的所有发行版，攻击者需具备本地用户权限即可利用，CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0948"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-12-19T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:49Z","remediation":"升级 GnoRPM 至 0.95 或更高版本，该版本已修复符号链接竞争条件。如无法升级，避免以 root 权限运行 GnoRPM，并确保临时文件目录（如 /tmp）设置了粘滞位（sticky bit），防止本地用户通过符号链接劫持提权。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-10/0043.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-10/0184.html","http://www.linux-mandrake.com/en/security/MDKSA-2000-055.php3?dis=7.0","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2000-072.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/136866","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1761","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5317","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/c6e3b04088d3a34fb448e0c7ffd377395dcc3ef8/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0948.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6e8a79e44f6fbd3ac137885a8646f81e8e0c401a/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0948.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0948","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0948.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0948.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/3355d48a7d0ca0d3b4124274995f7205f0bb89f2/2000/CVE-2000-0948.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/ca31171c444e5a175f3ac1833b0261c6587a34e9/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0948.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/9af727c40ac027294e4558abbc02d8967ee2a1d7/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-09xx/CVE-2000-0948.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0948.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/2ea9851780633b2caab16fe048a14b38ca9a0b56/content/CVE-2000-0948.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0910.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0907","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0907.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0934","title":"Red Hat Linux Glint 本地符号链接攻击任意文件覆盖漏洞","description":"Red Hat Linux 5.2 中的 Glint 工具存在符号链接攻击漏洞。Glint 是 RPM 包管理器的图形前端界面，在运行过程中以不安全的方式创建临时文件，未对文件路径进行充分校验。本地攻击者可通过在 Glint 创建临时文件前预置符号链接，将目标指向系统关键文件（如 /etc/passwd），从而在 Glint 以 root 权限运行时实现任意文件覆盖写入，导致系统拒绝服务或权限提升。该漏洞利用条件为拥有本地访问权限，无需额外认证，CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0934"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-12-19T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:48Z","remediation":"立即安装 Red Hat 官方安全公告 RHSA-2000:062 提供的 glint 更新包。由于 Red Hat Linux 5.2 已停止维护，建议升级到受支持的 Red Hat Enterprise Linux 版本。临时缓解措施：避免向不可信用户授予本地访问权限，并监控 /tmp 目录下的符号链接创建行为。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2000-062.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1703","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5271","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/27584df20575115093a915d82c76b5107dd9d51e/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0934.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c31c0a9b9af147bd58078ebf7769418f19d3f2e1/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0934.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0934","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0934.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0934.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/b6c80ad7b47e52f64ae2ee2b20e56d7eaaaa57fe/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-09xx/CVE-2000-0934.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/230692da2420d9855e520154fdb81ed9f2cb832a/2000/CVE-2000-0934.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/1d7706ed603ab73481cbc20e5bea092e02e7c9be/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0934.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0934.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0934.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0907.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0905","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0905.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0913","title":"Apache HTTP Server mod_rewrite 任意文件读取漏洞","description":"Apache HTTP Server 1.3.12 及更早版本中的 mod_rewrite 模块存在任意文件读取漏洞。当 RewriteRule 指令被扩展为包含正则表达式匹配的文件名时，远程攻击者可通过构造特制的 HTTP 请求，利用正则表达式回溯机制绕过路径限制，读取服务器上的任意文件，包括配置文件、密码文件等敏感信息。该漏洞无需身份认证即可远程利用，攻击复杂度低，影响所有使用受影响版本 Apache 的 Web 服务器。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0913"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-12-19T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:45Z","remediation":"立即将 Apache HTTP Server 升级至 1.3.14 或更高版本。如使用 Red Hat Linux，安装 RHSA-2000-088 或 RHSA-2000-095 提供的更新包；Caldera 用户安装 CSSA-2000-035.0 补丁；Mandrake 用户安装 MDKSA-2000-060-2 更新。临时缓解措施：审查并移除 RewriteRule 指令中引用正则表达式反向引用的目标路径，避免将用户可控输入直接拼接到替换目标中。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-09/0352.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-10/0174.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/hp/2000-q4/0021.html","http://www.calderasystems.com/support/security/advisories/CSSA-2000-035.0.txt","http://www.linux-mandrake.com/en/security/MDKSA-2000-060-2.php3?dis=7.1","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2000-088.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2000-095.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1728","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5310","https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/r5419c9ba0951ef73a655362403d12bb8d10fab38274deb3f005816f5%40%3Ccvs.httpd.apache.org%3E","https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/r5f9c22f9c28adbd9f00556059edc7b03a5d5bb71d4bb80257c0d34e4%40%3Ccvs.httpd.apache.org%3E","https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/r9f93cf6dde308d42a9c807784e8102600d0397f5f834890708bf6920%40%3Ccvs.httpd.apache.org%3E","https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/rb9c9f42dafa25d2f669dac2a536a03f2575bc5ec1be6f480618aee10%40%3Ccvs.httpd.apache.org%3E","https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/rf2f0f3611f937cf6cfb3b4fe4a67f69885855126110e1e3f2fb2728e%40%3Ccvs.httpd.apache.org%3E","https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/rf6449464fd8b7437704c55f88361b66f12d5b5f90bcce66af4be4ba9%40%3Ccvs.httpd.apache.org%3E","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a14f4e66db68a75a9270d6c9081e9ffb7f931cd8/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0913.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0913","https://github.com/Pa